 ## Unreleased
 
+- Gift vouchers are accepted as payment (`--payment voucher`) and cashed up on their own row.
 - The default `max_tickets_per_order` is now 12, up from 10.
 - Holds that expired more than `hold_keep_minutes` (default 60) ago are dropped when holds are
   saved, so the list of holds no longer grows for ever.
